      "text": "[4:40PM] #LagosIbadanExpress #Ogudu #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is quite slow from Olopomeji and descending the Gbagada bridge inwards Ifako bridge where the expansion joints will slow you down a bit, and better inwards Ogudu, Alapere, Apostolic and Ojota Bridge.\n\nMoving in to Old Toll Gate, Conoil, Magodo/Alausa Bridge to Otedola an do Berger inwards Kara is quite slow due ti an incident at OPIC.\n\nOur Men are strategically positioned within our Jurisdiction to ensure smooth traffic flow.\n\n @Sola_Giwa @gm_lastma @followlasg @GoldmyneTV @Mr_JAGs @gbenga_omo @TrafficChiefNG @channelstv @lagosMOT1 @lagostraffic961 @daily_trust @thecableng @walemusa @seunosiyemi_ @vanguardngrnews @MobilePunch @NigeriaNewsdesk @TheNationNews @GuardianNigeria @FRSCNigeria @Gidi_Traffic",
